---
title: Lifecycle Hook Middleware — Chain of Responsibility on Write-Tool POSTs
---
flowchart LR
    classDef hook fill:#F2F2F2,stroke:#1F1F1F,stroke-width:1px,color:#111111
    classDef live fill:#E2E2E2,stroke:#1F1F1F,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111111
    classDef plan fill:#FAFAFA,stroke:#1F1F1F,stroke-width:1px,color:#111111,stroke-dasharray:3 3
    classDef out  fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#1F1F1F,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#111111
    classDef block fill:#EAEAEA,stroke:#1F1F1F,stroke-width:1.2px,color:#111111

    REQ["POST /agent/tools/*<br/>(write tool)"]:::out --> H0

    H0["Hook 0 · Prompt injection scan<br/>user fields · injection_scan_flag"]:::hook
    H0 --> H1

    H1["Hook 1 · Confirmation audit<br/>(Phase II)"]:::live
    H1 --> H1a{"CHAT_MESSAGE +<br/>AGENT_ACTION_LOG<br/>confirmation turn?"}
    H1a -->|no| B1["HTTP 403 · log REJECTED<br/>zero-bypass guarantee"]:::block
    H1a -->|yes| H2

    H2["Hook 2 · Session key scope pre-check<br/>(Phase III)"]:::plan
    H2 --> H2a{"tool ∈ scope JSON<br/>value ≤ 500 USDC?"}
    H2a -->|no| B2["HTTP 403 · out-of-scope"]:::block
    H2a -->|yes| H3

    H3["Hook 3 · AML pre-check<br/>(Phase IV)"]:::plan
    H3 --> H3a{"iForest score <<br/>AI_ML_SECURITY_LOG?"}
    H3a -->|high risk| B3["Block · SAR compliance queue"]:::block
    H3a -->|ok| OK

    OK["Forward to MCP handler<br/>→ Express API → on-chain"]:::out
